    "Earnings are paid out on the 1st of each month for all commissions earned during the previous month (subject to a 30-day clearing period to account for any returns or cancellations).": "Thu nh\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thanh to\u00e1n v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 hoa h\u1ed3ng ki\u1ebfm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trong th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc (tu\u00e2n theo th\u1eddi gian thanh to\u00e1n l\u00e0 30 ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft m\u1ecdi tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c h\u1ee7y).",
    "Earnings are processed and paid out three times every month according to the following schedule:1st of the month: For earnings cleared during the previous period.11th of the month: For earnings cleared during the first week of the month.21st of the month:": "Thu nh\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u1eed l\u00fd v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n ba l\u1ea7n m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng theo l\u1ecbch tr\u00ecnh sau: Ng\u00e0y 1 c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng: \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi thu nh\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00f3a trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n tr\u01b0\u1edbc. Ng\u00e0y 11 c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng: \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi thu nh\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00f3a trong tu\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng. Ng\u00e0y 21 c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng:",
    "Earnings on or near the 1st of each month.\n\nStart with 12% commission on every order you bring in. Your commission rate increases as you make more sales!\n\nCommissions are approved approximately 35 days after the sale, after the refund period.": "Thu nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o ho\u1eb7c g\u1ea7n ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng.\n\nB\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u v\u1edbi 12% hoa h\u1ed3ng cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ea1n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n. T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 hoa h\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n t\u0103ng l\u00ean khi b\u1ea1n ki\u1ebfm \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u doanh s\u1ed1 h\u01a1n!\n\nHoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t kho\u1ea3ng 35 ng\u00e0y sau khi b\u00e1n, sau th\u1eddi gian ho\u00e0n tr\u1ea3.",
    "Earnings would be every two weeks": "Thu nh\u1eadp s\u1ebd l\u00e0 hai tu\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n",
