    "Net 30 days via PayPal (Monthly payout)": "Net 30 ng\u00e0y qua PayPal (Thanh to\u00e1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng)",
    "Net 30 \u2014 affiliates are paid on the 1st of each month for sales from the previous month.": "Net 30 \u2014 c\u00e1c chi nh\u00e1nh \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thanh to\u00e1n v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng cho doanh s\u1ed1 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc.",
    "Net 30. Commissions are approved after the 30-day return window and paid out on the 1st or 15th of each month.": "Net 30. Hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t sau th\u1eddi h\u1ea1n 30 ng\u00e0y ho\u00e0n tr\u1ea3 v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thanh to\u00e1n v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y 1 ho\u1eb7c ng\u00e0y 15 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng.",
    "Net 30. Paid on the 15th of each month for the prior month's approved commissions. Minimum payout threshold: $50.": "Net 30. \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u1ea3 v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y 15 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng cho s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc. Ng\u01b0\u1ee1ng thanh to\u00e1n t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u: $50.",
    "Net 30/60/90": "R\u00f2ng 30/60/90",
