    "Payouts occur in regular intervals.": "C\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n thanh to\u00e1n di\u1ec5n ra \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n.",
    "Payouts occur monthly on the 1st of every month.": "C\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n thanh to\u00e1n di\u1ec5n ra h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y 1 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng.",
