    "Refer to our Affiliate Program T&C https://girlielingerie.com/pages/affiliate-program-t-c": "Tham kh\u1ea3o \u0110i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n v\u00e0 \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh Li\u00ean k\u1ebft c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i https://girlielingerie.com/pages/affiliate-program-t-c",
    "Referral earnings are released 14 days after successful order completion.\nThis review period ensures quality assurance, verification, and secure processing for all parties.": "Thu nh\u1eadp gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e1t h\u00e0nh 14 ng\u00e0y sau khi ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.\nGiai \u0111o\u1ea1n xem x\u00e9t n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, x\u00e1c minh v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd an to\u00e0n cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c b\u00ean.",
    "Referral orders appear in your dashboard as soon as they are tracked. Commissions are validated 60 days after the order date and paid monthly by bank transfer on the next payout date, normally the 15th. The minimum payout is $50, and smaller balances auto": "L\u1ec7nh gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n trong b\u1ea3ng \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ngay khi ch\u00fang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c theo d\u00f5i. Hoa h\u1ed3ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn 60 ng\u00e0y sau ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thanh to\u00e1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng b\u1eb1ng chuy\u1ec3n kho\u1ea3n ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y thanh to\u00e1n ti\u1ebfp theo, th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 ng\u00e0y 15. Kho\u1ea3n thanh to\u00e1n t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u l\u00e0 $50 v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 d\u01b0 nh\u1ecf h\u01a1n s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng",
    "Referrals will be approved 2 weeks after order date and payouts are at the end of each month.": "C\u00e1c l\u01b0\u1ee3t gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t 2 tu\u1ea7n sau ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 kho\u1ea3n thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n v\u00e0o cu\u1ed1i m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng.",
    "Right away!": "Ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c!",
    "Rolling 60 days - minimum commission for payout AUD$100": "K\u00e9o d\u00e0i 60 ng\u00e0y - hoa h\u1ed3ng t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ec3 thanh to\u00e1n 100 \u0111\u00f4 la \u00dac",
    "Se paga los 15 de cada mes": "Se paga los 15 th\u00e1ng sau",
    "Second week of each month": "Tu\u1ea7n th\u1ee9 hai m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng",
    "Settlement takes place on the 10th of the following month.": "Vi\u1ec7c thanh to\u00e1n di\u1ec5n ra v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y 10 c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng ti\u1ebfp theo.",
    "Seventh day of next month": "Ng\u00e0y m\u1ed3ng b\u1ea3y th\u00e1ng sau",
    "Standard affiliates - Paid every 30 days \nTop Performers - Paid every 15 days\n\nPayout rate: 15% commission": "Li\u00ean k\u1ebft ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n - \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c thanh to\u00e1n 30 ng\u00e0y m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n \nNg\u01b0\u1eddi bi\u1ec3u di\u1ec5n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u - \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u1ea3 ti\u1ec1n 15 ng\u00e0y m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n\n\nT\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 xu\u1ea5t chi: hoa h\u1ed3ng 15%",
    "Store Credit will be given out quarterly": "T\u00edn d\u1ee5ng c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trao h\u00e0ng qu\u00fd",
    "The 10th of each month": "Ng\u00e0y 10 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng",
    "The 15th of each month": "Ng\u00e0y 15 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng",
    "The 15th of every month. If you do a promotion the 12th-14th of any month you will be paid out the fallowing month on the 15th.": "Ng\u00e0y 15 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y 12-14 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 th\u00e1ng n\u00e0o, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thanh to\u00e1n v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y 15 c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng c\u00f2n l\u1ea1i.",
    "The 1st of each Month": "Ng\u00e0y 1 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng",
    "The 1st of each month": "Ng\u00e0y 1 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng",
    "The 1st of every two months.": "Ng\u00e0y 1 c\u1ee7a m\u1ed7i hai th\u00e1ng.",
    "The 25th of every month": "Ng\u00e0y 25 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng",
    "The 30th of every month, 28th in February": "Ng\u00e0y 30 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng, ng\u00e0y 28 th\u00e1ng 2",
    "The affiliate payout process operates on a 30-day schedule.": "Qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh thanh to\u00e1n li\u00ean k\u1ebft ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng theo l\u1ecbch tr\u00ecnh 30 ng\u00e0y.",
    "The billing will be done once a month": "Vi\u1ec7c thanh to\u00e1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n",
    "The commission for the previous month is paid on the 10th of each month": "Hoa h\u1ed3ng c\u1ee7a th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thanh to\u00e1n v\u00e0o ng\u00e0y 10 h\u00e0ng th\u00e1ng",
    "The commission payment period is up to 15 days.": "Th\u1eddi gian thanh to\u00e1n hoa h\u1ed3ng l\u00ean t\u1edbi 15 ng\u00e0y.",
    "The first Friday of each month.": "Th\u1ee9 S\u00e1u \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean c\u1ee7a m\u1ed7i th\u00e1ng.",
