    "Weekly.": "H\u00e0ng tu\u1ea7n.",
    "When $100 limit is reach we pay out within 15 days": "Khi \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ebfn gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n 100 USD, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i s\u1ebd thanh to\u00e1n trong v\u00f2ng 15 ng\u00e0y",
    "When Total payment comes to 50 EURO": "Khi T\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n thanh to\u00e1n l\u00ean \u0111\u1ebfn 50 EURO",
