    "Within 30 days of each sale.": "Trong v\u00f2ng 30 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n b\u00e1n.",
    "Within 45 days of transaction": "Trong v\u00f2ng 45 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ng\u00e0y giao d\u1ecbch",
    "Within 48 hours after your customer completes their 7-day trail period.": "Trong v\u00f2ng 48 gi\u1edd sau khi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh giai \u0111o\u1ea1n th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m 7 ng\u00e0y c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd.",
    "Within 5 days": "Trong v\u00f2ng 5 ng\u00e0y",
